// ---- 88c_music.js ----
// ───────────────────────── music: sparse, modal, procedural, with long silences ─────────────────────────
// Voices: drone (detuned saws and a fifth), plucked string (Karplus-Strong), bowed string (saws, vibrato, slow attack), frame drum, small bells.
